direction: right
release: Scheduled release {style.fill: "#fff7ed"}
post: Send starts {style.fill: "#eff6ff"}
start: Handler starts {style.fill: "#f0fdfa"}
finish: Handler finishes {style.fill: "#f0fdfa"}
release -> post: Publication lateness\ntimer + publisher scheduling
post -> start: Queue response\nsend + queueing + receiver scheduling
start -> finish: Handler duration\nincludes waits and time off CPU
note: "Release-to-start = publication lateness + queue response\nA promptly handled message can still have been published late.\nThis is a causal path, not a timeline drawn to scale." {shape: text}
